<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>BrainElevate</title>

  <!-- External CSS & Icons -->
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/header.css" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/landing-page.css" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css" />
  <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.2/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
  <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons/font/bootstrap-icons.css" rel="stylesheet">
</head>

<body>
  <!-- Main Content -->
  <main>
    <!-- Navbar -->
    <%- include('partials/header') %>

    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="hero-content">
        <h1>Advance Your Career in a Digitalized World</h1>
        <p>We provide you with unrestricted access to the greatest courses from top specialists, allowing you to learn
          countless practical lessons in a range of topics.</p>
        <a class="hero-cta-btn" href="/signup">Join Now</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- About Us Section -->
    <section class="section aboutus">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="row g-4 align-items-center">
          <!-- Left column -->
          <div class="col-lg-6">
            <p class="section-title text-danger">
              <span class="line "></span> About Us
            </p>
            <h1 class="aboutus-title">We Help Grow <br>Student Careers.</h1>
            <p>We've been doing this for over a decade since we always want to give learning services that aren't taught
              in schools.</p>
          </div>

          <!-- Right column -->
          <div class="col-lg-6 text-dark">
            <div class="row align-items-center g-4">
              <!-- Image column -->
              <div class="col-md-9 d-flex justify-content-center justify-content-md-start">
                <div class="about-img-container m-0">
                  <img src="/images/pexels-charlotte-may-5966011.jpg" alt="About Us Stats Image" class="img-fluid">
                </div>
              </div>
              <!-- Text column -->
              <div class="col-md-3 aboutus-stats">
                <h2 class="text-danger">3M</h2>
                <h6>students already enrolled</h6>
                <h2 class="text-danger">1.2K+</h2>
                <h6>courses available in various categories</h6>
                <h2 class="text-danger">600</h2>
                <h6>Experienced authors who will teach you</h6>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Features Section -->
    <section class="section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="row g-5 align-items-center">
          <!-- Left Grid (Features list) -->
          <div class="col-lg-6">
            <div class="row g-4">
              <div class="col-12 col-md-6">
                <div class="feature-card">
                  <i class="bi bi-chat-dots text-danger"></i>
                  <h6 class="text-danger">Discussion 24/7</h6>
                  <p>The community is always there for you if you have difficulty learning the course. Join through Telegram.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="col-12 col-md-6">
                <div class="feature-card">
                  <i class="bi bi-journal-text text-danger"></i>
                  <h6 class="text-danger">Lecture Notes</h6>
                  <p>Lecture notes are available, so you don’t have to take notes manually.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="col-12 col-md-6">
                <div class="feature-card">
                  <i class="bi bi-check2-circle text-danger"></i>
                  <h6 class="text-danger">Practice for Free</h6>
                  <p>Test your skills with practice tests that have been provided on our platform.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Right Grid (Why us) -->
          <div class="col-lg-6">
            <div class="feature-card why-us-card">
              <p class="section-title text-danger">
                <span class="line"></span> Why Us
              </p>
              <h2 class="why-us-title">Our Special Features <br>We Build For You</h2>
              <p class="mb-4">BrainElevate is a platform that helps students in advancing their career by providing solutions for
                simple and flexible online learning, allowing you to study anywhere and anytime at affordable prices.
              </p>
              <img src="/images/pexels-george-pak-7972525.jpg" alt="Why Us Feature Image" class="why-us-img">
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Testimonials Section -->
    <section class="section testisec">
      <div class="container">
        <p class="section-title text-danger">
          <span class="line"></span> Testimonials
        </p>
        <h2 class="text-center mb-5 text-white">What Our Students Say About Us</h2>
         
        <div class="row g-4">
          <div class="col-md-4">
            <div class="testimonial-card">
              <p>“Thanks to Brain Elevate Learning I finally understood complex topics in hours — not weeks. The interactive modules, real-world examples and clear explanations made all the difference.”</p>
              <div>
                <h6>Sukran Memis</h6>
                <small>Software Engineer</small>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-md-4">
            <div class="testimonial-card">
              <p>“As someone returning to learning after a long break, I was worried I’d fall behind. But Brain Elevate’s friendly pace and great support helped me feel confident again. I got better results than I expected.”</p>
              <div>
                <h6>Alika Yuksel</h6>
                <small>Software Engineer</small>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-md-4">
            <div class="testimonial-card">
              <p>“The courses on Brain Elevate aren’t just theory — they pushed me to apply what I learned. My productivity at work went up, and I now lead a team thanks to the skills I gained.”</p>
              <div>
                <h6>Misel Corp</h6>
                <small>Software Engineer</small>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CTA Section -->
    <section class="cta-section text-center text-white">
      <div class="container py-5">
        <h1 class="mb-3">Ready to Start Your Courses<br>and Grow Your Career</h1>
        <p class="mb-4">
          Experts teach you everything from the comfort of your own home. Improve your career today by 
          enrolling in excellent courses at affordable prices.
        </p>
        <a href="/signup" class="cta-btn text-decoration-none">Get Started</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <!-- Footer -->
  <%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>
<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.2/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
</html>